label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Brahim: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}

if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34.0:
	Brahim: Taking a quick walk from Tatay's porch. Brought a fresh bronze piece if you want to trace a talisman!
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67.0:
	Brahim: My brush hand is a bit stiff from sorting herbs. Care to co-inscribe a quick charm with me?
else:
	Brahim: Always calmer under your awning than grading bluebooks! Up for a quick talisman practice?
- Sure, pass me the brush.
	[signal arg="minigame:talisman_random"]
	if {Transaction_MinigameWon}:
		Brahim: Top marks again! Steady strokes like that make Tatay look twice. Salamat!
	else:
		Brahim: Haha, good warm-up! Every shaky line still teaches the wrist. Salamat for trying!
- Hands are full right now, Brahim.
	Brahim: Totally fair! Catch your breath, I will save the ink for our next pass.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34.0:
	Brahim: Remember to stretch your shoulders behind that counter. Old professor advice!
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67.0:
	Brahim: Tatay's lagundi tea smells extra strong past the creek. Better head back before it cools!
else:
	Brahim: Funny how a quiet street teaches you more than a whole semester of lectures. Ingat!
[end_timeline]
